{"title":"2012 UK MOG","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>2012 UK MOG problems and solutions (held on 20 September 2012). The first link contains the full set of test problems.  The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UK_MOG_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 UK MOG Answer Key (page does not exist)\">2012 UK MOG Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UK_MOG_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 UK MOG Problems (page does not exist)\">2012 UK MOG Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UK_MOG_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 1\">2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UK_MOG_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UK_MOG_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UK_MOG_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UK_MOG_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UK_MOG_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">2012 UK MOG Problems/Problem 5</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-edit